        },
        "D": {
          "text": "had acted"
        }
      },
      "explanation": {
        "text": "'Had she known' is an inverted third conditional (= If she had known). The result clause is <b>would have + past participle</b>.",
        "topic": "Conditionals",
        "concept": "Third conditional",
        "formula": "Had + subject + past participle, would have + past participle"
